@startuml
title FE-05 Manager Approves Quote and Member Pays in Full
actor Manager
actor Member
participant CustomOrderService
participant CustomOrderPaymentFacade
participant PaymentGatewayCheckoutPort
database CustomOrderQuoteRepository
Manager -> CustomOrderService : approve quote + version
CustomOrderService -> CustomOrderQuoteRepository : save approved quote and expiry
Member -> CustomOrderService : open My Custom Orders
Member -> CustomOrderPaymentFacade : start full payment
CustomOrderPaymentFacade -> PaymentGatewayCheckoutPort : create checkout URL
PaymentGatewayCheckoutPort --> Member : payment redirect
PaymentGatewayCheckoutPort --> CustomOrderPaymentFacade : verified callback
CustomOrderPaymentFacade -> CustomOrderService : apply PAID outcome idempotently
CustomOrderService --> Member : PAID and production pending
note over Member
Expired unpaid quote cannot be paid.
end note
@enduml
